# INVWINHF.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:DATA, a directory, which DOS refuses to read as the settings
# file: the message box names the file and what its DOS error means, and
# ENTER on it ends the program before the frame opens.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINHF.SNP is its snapshot.
S NOCFG
K ENTER
S GONE
